{
    "title": "CarX Rally",
    "description": "CarX Rally\r\nJoin the exciting rally races and become a CarX Rally legend!\r\nExperience realistic physics and car damage in dynamic rally races. Download CarX Rally for free and open up a world of extreme racing.\r\n\r\nGame features:\r\n- Realistic physics: Feel the genuine power of a rally car. Control your car, taking into account various types of track surfaces and difficult conditions.\r\n- Championships: Take part in tons of classic car rally tournaments and more. Prove your mastery in all kinds of races. The new championship system allows you to choose your difficulty level.\r\n- Diverse cars: A large selection of cars will satisfy the tastes of any racer. Find the perfect car for your driving style.\r\n- Car settings: Configure your car however you see fit. Use different tires to suit different surfaces and weather conditions.\r\n- Realistic damage: Experience extreme conditions and see how your car reacts in collisions and accidents.\r\n- Improved graphics and animation: Enjoy detailed locations, improved night-time lighting and dashboard animation.\r\n- Optimization and stability: Constant performance improvements and bug fixing provide a smooth gaming experience.\r\n\r\nWhat\u2019s waiting for you:\r\n- Pass all checkpoints and reach the finish line. Your determination and skills will help you overcome all obstacles on your way to victory.\r\n- Explore various tracks and locations while enjoying fantastic graphics and the authentic rally racing atmosphere. Participate in epic races and challenges to become the best driver.\r\n- Feel the speed and adrenaline in races on various tracks, from realistic simulations to extreme conditions.\r\n\r\nCarX Rally is your opportunity to become a rally racing champion. Ready to accept the challenge?\r\nDownload now and start your rally adventure!",
    "descriptionHTML": "CarX Rally<br>Join the exciting rally races and become a CarX Rally legend!<br>Experience realistic physics and car damage in dynamic rally races. Download CarX Rally for free and open up a world of extreme racing.<br><br>Game features:<br>- Realistic physics: Feel the genuine power of a rally car. Control your car, taking into account various types of track surfaces and difficult conditions.<br>- Championships: Take part in tons of classic car rally tournaments and more. Prove your mastery in all kinds of races. The new championship system allows you to choose your difficulty level.<br>- Diverse cars: A large selection of cars will satisfy the tastes of any racer. Find the perfect car for your driving style.<br>- Car settings: Configure your car however you see fit. Use different tires to suit different surfaces and weather conditions.<br>- Realistic damage: Experience extreme conditions and see how your car reacts in collisions and accidents.<br>- Improved graphics and animation: Enjoy detailed locations, improved night-time lighting and dashboard animation.<br>- Optimization and stability: Constant performance improvements and bug fixing provide a smooth gaming experience.<br><br>What\u2019s waiting for you:<br>- Pass all checkpoints and reach the finish line. Your determination and skills will help you overcome all obstacles on your way to victory.<br>- Explore various tracks and locations while enjoying fantastic graphics and the authentic rally racing atmosphere. Participate in epic races and challenges to become the best driver.<br>- Feel the speed and adrenaline in races on various tracks, from realistic simulations to extreme conditions.<br><br>CarX Rally is your opportunity to become a rally racing champion. Ready to accept the challenge?<br>Download now and start your rally adventure!",
